### 新增领域模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试领域",
  "code": "test_domain",
  "parentId": 0,
  "description": "这是一个测试领域",
  "type": "test",
  "status": 1,
  "sort": 10,
  "remark": "测试备注"
}

### 更新领域模型
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "更新的领域",
  "code": "updated_domain",
  "parentId": 0,
  "description": "这是一个更新的领域",
  "type": "business",
  "status": 1,
  "sort": 5,
  "remark": "更新的备注"
}

### 获得领域模型详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获得领域模型分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&name=测试
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 删除领域模型
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/delete?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获得领域模型列表（树形结构）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/list?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获得领域模型列表（带统计信息）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/list-with-statistics?parentId=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 获得领域模型树形结构（Element Plus Tree格式）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ================ 对标Category的批量关联功能测试 ================

### 批量创建字段领域关联
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/field-relations/batch-create?fieldId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1, 2]

### 批量创建字段领域关联（带配置）
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/field-relations/batch-create-with-config?fieldId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "1": {
    "required": true,
    "sort": 1,
    "remark": "重要字段"
  },
  "2": {
    "required": false,
    "sort": 2,
    "remark": "可选字段"
  }
}

### 检查字段领域关联是否存在
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/domain/field-relations/exists?fieldId=1&domainId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

